1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,973
Voyager one, launched in nineteen seventy seven, is now more than twenty four billion kilometres away, far beyond the reach of useful sunlight.

2
00:00:09,973 --> 00:00:12,031
Yet it is still talking to us.

3
00:00:12,031 --> 00:00:14,088
Where does its electricity come from?

